---
layout: base.njk
title: Market Insights | Michael's Investment Club
description: Michael's posts on markets, economics, investing, and financial literacy.
permalink: /insights/index.html
---
<div class="container">
  <section>
    <div class="eyebrow">Michael's Writing</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem);color:var(--navy)">Market Insights</h1>
    <p class="lead">Short observations on investing, companies, economic developments, and financial literacy.</p>
    <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <div class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
